Alembic migrations for RUNWAY.

The database URL is read from RUNWAY_DATABASE_URL via app.core.config, so
migrations always target the same database the application uses.

    ../run.sh migrate              upgrade to head
    ../run.sh migrate-status       show current and head revisions
    ../run.sh migrate-new "msg"    autogenerate a new revision

SQLite runs in batch mode automatically (see env.py) so the same revision
scripts work on both SQLite and PostgreSQL.
